## GLOBAL VISUAL SYSTEM

- **Background particle field:** 40 dots (2px, WHITE 8% opacity), drift downward 0.3px/frame on every scene.
- **Blueprint grid:** 40px spacing, 1px lines, CYAN at 4% opacity. Persistent on all scene backgrounds.
- **Scene transitions:** A 3px horizontal line (CYAN/MAGENTA alternating) sweeps left→right in 8 frames. Old content dissolves in the line's wake. Exception: silence beats use HARD CUTS to black.
- **Reusable components:** Data Counter (count-up over 20 frames), Quote Card (SURFACE bg, colored left border, gradient avatar), Score Flag, Trophy.

