- **Frame 3060–3210:** SILENCE BEAT. Black + grid + particles. DIM text fades in: "WHEN AI DOESN'T KNOW THE ANSWER…" Hold 2s.
- **Frame 3210–3300:** A vintage LIE DETECTOR machine materializes — stylized, art deco meets cyberpunk. Paper roll feeds through. Needle arm rests at center. Warm amber glow. Label: "AA-OMNISCIENCE TEST"
- **Frame 3300–3420:** TEST 1 — CLAUDE. A CYAN silhouette sits at the machine. Needle draws moderate oscillations. Paper marker: **36%**. Stamp: "MODERATE" in AMBER.
- **Frame 3420–3510:** TEST 2 — GEMINI. A WHITE silhouette sits. Needle more erratic, bigger swings. Marker: **50%**. Stamp: "COIN FLIP" in AMBER.
- **Frame 3510–3690:** TEST 3 — GPT-5.5. A MAGENTA silhouette sits. Needle starts and IMMEDIATELY goes HAYWIRE. Wild oscillations — needle hitting paper edges. Paper FEEDS FASTER. Line is a JAGGED SAWTOOTH. Machine starts SHAKING — bolts rattle, amber glow flickers. Marker prints: **86%**. Stamp tries to print but MISSES because of shaking: "CRI—" smear, then prints: "WHEN STUMPED — INVENTS ANSWERS" in RED. Machine sparks once, powers down. Text: **"HIGHEST ACCURACY. HIGHEST FABRICATION."** Half GREEN, half RED.
